  "tillverkar_beskrivning": {
    "text": "Cadiz protects any patio against excessive heat, year in, year out. This high-end sun canopy also offers various options including dimmable LED lighting in the box, arms and extension pole and an extra-large valance. Cadiz stands out due to its closed, rounded-edge box. Thanks to this closed box, the fabric is protected against dirt and will look amazing for years. Even when the sun is low, you can protect your terrace and house from the heat, thanks to the dynamic vario-valance (up to 2 m) integrated into the extension pole. This sun canopy, which has a drop of up to 4 metres and has a maximum width of 7 metres, offers the largest area of shade on the market. Cadiz can be linked to provide even more shade! Can be coupled up to 12 m. Bring your evenings to life with the Cadiz folding arm awning and discover a range of atmospheric LED lighting options: Create a warm ambiance with indirect light in the box and extension pole. Choose a discrete glow with direct light in the box. Add a stylish touch with direct light in the arms. Opt for maximum atmosphere with direct light in both arms and box. Invisible, integrated cabling for a refined look. Tested for durability with rigorous tests of up to 25,000 cycles, which equates to 25 years of opening and closing every day. Long life expectancy due to perfect cable tension and run-out, offering exceptional reliability. Robust construction thanks to two durable, stainless steel cables made of galvanised steel in each arm. Luxurious finish thanks to exclusive 'invisibly wired' profile which provides a sleek and modern design.",
    "kalla": {
      "domän": "harol.com",
      "url": "https://www.harol.com/en/products/solar-shading/folding-arm-awnings/cadiz/"
    },
